    - enforce the 5-team cap on the backend too, not just the frontend


create functions to join stats and add api branch(es)
    - postgres function to compare a pokemon's rank across current / previous / older or beyond
    - include rank change (up/down/new) so the frontend doesn't have to work it out
    - possible endpoints:
        /apiv1/compare/<tier>      top 25 with rank movement
        /apiv1/pokemon/<name>      one pokemon across all tiers + time periods
