move pokedex from smog_usage_stats over to here, use as reference data to save using pokeapi
   X - pokedex table: dex number, name, slug (pokeapi name, e.g. "great-tusk"), types,
      base stats, abilities, sprite url
   X - one-off seed script that fills it from pokeapi, then never calls pokeapi for these again
